  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/10/IMG_5781.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\">Aquest divendres s&#39;ha fet la presentaci&oacute; de la reina de les festes de Ribesalbes, Leyre Vicent Corella, i la seua cort d&#39;honor:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\">&nbsp;Mayte Ordu&ntilde;a Olucha, Tania Bol&oacute;s &Aacute;lvaro, Paula Ventura Serrano i Nadia V&aacute;zquez Bachero</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\">. Ha actuat de mantenidor l&#39;escriptor Juanma Velasco Centelles.</span></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinaribesalbes18/img_5661.jpg\" alt=\"img_5661\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinaribesalbes18/img_5662.jpg\" alt=\"img_5662\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinaribesalbes18/img_5665.jpg\" alt=\"img_5665\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinaribesalbes18/img_5666.jpg\" alt=\"img_5666\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinaribesalbes18/img_5667.jpg\" alt=\"img_5667\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinaribesalbes18/img_5669.jpg\" alt=\"img_5669\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinaribesalbes18/img_5672.jpg\" alt=\"img_5672\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439e